# Conversion Splunk des règles Sigma - générée par : sigma convert -t splunk -p sysmon -p splunk_windows <règle>
# Preuve de déployabilité. À régénérer avec le pipeline du SIEM réellement utilisé.

# --- 01_office_lance_powershell_encode.yml
source="WinEventLog:Microsoft-Windows-Sysmon/Operational" EventCode=1 ParentImage IN ("*\\winword.exe", "*\\excel.exe", "*\\powerpnt.exe", "*\\outlook.exe", "*\\msaccess.exe") Image IN ("*\\powershell.exe", "*\\pwsh.exe") CommandLine IN ("* -enc*", "* -e *", "* -w hidden*", "* -windowstyle hidden*", "*FromBase64String*")

# --- 02_proxy_telechargement_executable_domaines_campagne.yml
"cs-host" IN ("*cdn-svc-update.test", "*api-telemetry-eu.test", "*static-assets-cache.test") "c-uri" IN ("*.exe", "*.dll", "*.ps1")

# --- 03_tache_planifiee_imitant_edge_update.yml
source="WinEventLog:Microsoft-Windows-Sysmon/Operational" EventCode=1 Image="*\\schtasks.exe" CommandLine="*/create*" CommandLine="*MicrosoftEdgeUpdateTask*" NOT ParentImage="*\\Microsoft\\EdgeUpdate\\*"

# --- 04_registre_run_wintelemetry.yml
source="WinEventLog:Microsoft-Windows-Sysmon/Operational" EventCode=13 TargetObject="*\\Software\\Microsoft\\Windows\\CurrentVersion\\Run\\WinTelemetry"

# --- 05_dns_domaines_campagne.yml
query IN ("*cdn-svc-update.test", "*api-telemetry-eu.test", "*static-assets-cache.test", "*mail-secure-login.test", "*helios-energy-portal.test")

# --- 06_explorer_parent_inhabituel.yml
source="WinEventLog:Microsoft-Windows-Sysmon/Operational" EventCode=1 Image="*\\explorer.exe" NOT (ParentImage IN ("*\\userinit.exe", "*\\winlogon.exe", "*\\explorer.exe", "*\\svchost.exe", "*\\sihost.exe", "*\\RuntimeBroker.exe", "*\\taskmgr.exe"))

# --- 07_rdp_serveur_source_non_autorisee.yml
source="WinEventLog:Security" EventCode=4624 LogonType=10 NOT (IpAddress="10.20.99.0/24" OR IpAddress IN ("127.0.0.1", "::1", "-"))

# --- 08_acces_memoire_lsass.yml
source="WinEventLog:Microsoft-Windows-Sysmon/Operational" EventCode=10 TargetImage="*\\lsass.exe" GrantedAccess IN ("0x1010", "0x1410", "0x1438", "0x143a", "0x1fffff") NOT (SourceImage IN ("C:\\Windows\\System32\\*", "C:\\Windows\\SysWOW64\\*", "C:\\Program Files\\Windows Defender\\*", "C:\\ProgramData\\Microsoft\\Windows Defender\\*")) OR SourceImage="*\\rundll32.exe"

# --- 09_compte_svc_backup_temp.yml
source="WinEventLog:Security" EventCode IN (4720, 4726) TargetUserName="svc-backup-temp"

# --- 10_parefeu_ip_commande_exfiltration.yml
dst_ip IN ("198.51.100.23", "198.51.100.24", "203.0.113.14", "203.0.113.28")

# --- 11_effacement_journal_securite_wevtutil.yml
source="WinEventLog:Microsoft-Windows-Sysmon/Operational" EventCode=1 Image="*\\wevtutil.exe" OR OriginalFileName="wevtutil.exe" CommandLine IN ("* cl *", "* clear-log *")

# --- 12_fichiers_outils_et_collecte.yml
source="WinEventLog:Microsoft-Windows-Sysmon/Operational" EventCode=11 TargetFilename IN ("*\\svchost_update.exe", "*\\rundll32_helper.dll", "*\\Windows\\Temp\\~df3a9.tmp")

# --- 14_empreintes_binaires_campagne.yml
source="WinEventLog:Microsoft-Windows-Sysmon/Operational" EventCode=1 Hashes IN ("*cdf03e90d85977619f7881a13f59a275812dbf0e4ae29874493728b0ef78ebc9*", "*f4109cd2860816d568c5581edf8ed5df28d35471fa8ff849e9ee2451b69135f0*")

# --- 15_balayage_interne_smb_rdp_correlation.yml
dst_port IN (445, 3389)

| bin _time span=5m
| stats dc(dst_ip) as value_count by _time src_ip

| search value_count >= 30
